# Darts App — FSD Architecture Rules

## Layer Map (import direction: top → bottom only)

```
app/          → providers, router, layouts (HubLayout, FlowLayout), hub theme hook, global styles
pages/        → home, friends-games, solo-games, game-setup, game, stats, trophies, social, board
widgets/      → app-header, bottom-nav, dartboard, scoreboard, game-header, game-statistics
features/     → select-game, select-solo-game, manage-players, record-throw, end-turn, resume-game, current-games, daily-challenge, finish-game
entities/     → player, dart-sector, game, game-rules, daily-challenge, game-history, achievements, board-theme
shared/       → ui (shadcn), lib (cn, id), config (routes)
```

## Import Rules

1. **Allowed**: import from same layer's slice via public API (`index.ts`) OR from layers below.
2. **Forbidden**: importing from layers above; cross-slice imports within the same layer (except `shared`).
3. **Public API**: every slice exports only through `index.ts` at slice root.
4. **Segment naming**: use `ui/`, `model/`, `lib/`, `api/` inside slices.

## Slice Responsibilities

| Slice | Path | Purpose |
|-------|------|---------|
| app | `src/app/` | Bootstrap, router, global CSS |
| home | `src/pages/home/` | Hub home: friends card + daily challenge |
| friends-games | `src/pages/friends-games/` | Multiplayer game picker |
| solo-games | `src/pages/solo-games/` | Solo training picker |
| game-setup | `src/pages/game-setup/` | Player list and turn order |
| game | `src/pages/game/` | Active game screen |
| stats | `src/pages/stats/` | History aggregates and recent games |
| trophies | `src/pages/trophies/` | Achievements grid |
| social | `src/pages/social/` | Local player rankings + invite link |
| board | `src/pages/board/` | Dartboard skin picker |
| app-header | `src/widgets/app-header/` | Brand header + hamburger menu |
| bottom-nav | `src/widgets/bottom-nav/` | Hub bottom tabs |
| dartboard | `src/widgets/dartboard/` | SVG board + click handling |
| scoreboard | `src/widgets/scoreboard/` | Score table, turn indicator, remove player |
| game-header | `src/widgets/game-header/` | Game title, pause/home, new game action |
| game-statistics | `src/widgets/game-statistics/` | Post-game throw stats per player |
| select-game | `src/features/select-game/` | Game type picker UI |
| select-solo-game | `src/features/select-solo-game/` | Solo game picker UI |
| manage-players | `src/features/manage-players/` | Add/remove/reorder players |
| record-throw | `src/features/record-throw/` | Throw recording hook |
| end-turn | `src/features/end-turn/` | Early turn end + throw summary |
| resume-game | `src/features/resume-game/` | Resume dialog + result dialog |
| current-games | `src/features/current-games/` | Open sessions list on home |
| daily-challenge | `src/features/daily-challenge/` | Daily challenge card + start hook |
| finish-game | `src/features/finish-game/` | History/daily/achievements side-effects |
| player | `src/entities/player/` | Player model |
| dart-sector | `src/entities/dart-sector/` | Sector types, scoring helpers |
| game | `src/entities/game/` | Session types, multi-session Zustand store |
| game-rules | `src/entities/game-rules/` | Rule engines + registry |
| daily-challenge | `src/entities/daily-challenge/` | Daily rotation + progress persist |
| game-history | `src/entities/game-history/` | Finished games persist + aggregates |
| achievements | `src/entities/achievements/` | Trophy definitions + unlock rules |
| board-theme | `src/entities/board-theme/` | Dartboard palettes + selected theme persist |
| ui | `src/shared/ui/` | shadcn components |
| lib | `src/shared/lib/` | Utilities |
| config | `src/shared/config/` | Routes |

## Adding a New Game

1. Create engine in `src/entities/game-rules/lib/<game>-engine.ts`
2. Register in `src/entities/game-rules/model/registry.ts` (`GAME_DEFINITIONS`)
3. Extend `GameConfig` / `PlayerState` in `src/entities/game/model/types.ts` if needed
4. Update scoreboard rendering if the UI differs
5. **Update this file** with the new slice/engine entry

## Tech Stack

- Vite + React + TypeScript
- shadcn/ui with scoped `.hub` dark theme (HubLayout + FlowLayout)
- Zustand + persist (localStorage keys: `darts-game-storage`, `darts-daily-challenge-storage`, `darts-history-storage`, `darts-achievements-storage`, `darts-board-theme-storage`)
- react-router-dom

## UI Language

Russian (ru)

## Update Policy

When adding or removing slices, update the Layer Map and Slice Responsibilities table in this file.
